@host = http://localhost:5218

### Liveness - o processo esta de pe? (nao toca no banco)
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness - da para atender? (consulta o PostgreSQL do Clever Cloud)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Cadastrar aluno -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alumni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Oliveira",
  "email": "maria.oliveira@exemplo.com"
}

### Repetir o mesmo e-mail -> 409 Conflict
# Demonstra o Result pattern: o erro nasce no AlumniService como
# AlumniErrors.EmailAlreadyInUse e vira ProblemDetails no ApiController.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alumni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Oliveira (duplicada)",
  "email": "maria.oliveira@exemplo.com"
}

### E-mail invalido -> 400 Bad Request
# Barrado pelas DataAnnotations, antes mesmo de o controller executar.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alumni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fulano",
  "email": "nao-e-email"
}

### Nome curto demais -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/alumni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "fulano@exemplo.com"
}

### Listar todos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/alumni

### Listar todos, pedindo compressao Brotli
# Confira o cabecalho Content-Encoding: br na resposta.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/alumni
Accept-Encoding: br, gzip

### Documento OpenAPI 3.1 cru
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
